<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Segue EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Segue EPS view cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial said analyst Kris Tuttle lowered his earnings estimates on Segue Software Inc.</p>
<p>-- Cut Q2 estimate to $0.01 per share from $0.08.</p>
<p>-- Cut fiscal 1997 estimate to $0.14 from $0.37.</p>
<p>-- Cut fiscal 1998 estimate to $0.29 from $0.52.</p>
<p>-- Kept shares rated short- and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Late Monday, Segue said it would post roughly &quot;break-even&quot; results in its second quarter, well below consensus estimates and down from a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 4-5/8 to 8-1/2.</p>
</text>
